gsu|a|of Crook ; Characterized by a crook or curve; not straight; turning; bent; twisted; deformed. ; Not straightforward; deviating from rectitude; distorted from the right. ; False; dishonest; fraudulent; as, crooked dealings.	e:1vcq,35,1~1vcq,35,1
